  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Beautiful, 3 Bedroom, 2 1/2 bathroom home in quaint Inlet Beach neighborhood with short walk or bike ride to beach access and 5 minute drive to historic 30a. Home is located adjacent to Camp Helen State Park and offers access to community lake-front pool and private access to Powell Lake. Enjoy days on the white sand beaches of the Gulf of Mexico and evenings relaxing by the pool, exploring the lake by kayak or paddle board, or fishing off the peer. <br><br>Our coastal, comfy family home features an open floor plan perfect for game and movie nights. Prepare a gourmet meal in the fully equipped kitchen around the large island, or grill out and enjoy the expansive outdoor patio equipped with gas grill, firepit and seating for all. The three bedrooms are located on the second floor. The master bedroom is a true master suite, complete with king bed, desk, large HD TV and jetted tub in the private master bathroom. Guest room features a queen bed and large HD TV. The bunk room is cozy for kids and adults alike with two, twin over full bunks. Regardless of the room everyone will enjoy a great night sleep on the upgraded mattresses throughout the entire home, including the sleeper sofa in the living room. <br> <br>The house is fully equipped for a short or long stay with high speed wireless internet. You can find all the basic beach gear for your use in the garage including wagon, small cooler, beach chairs and various toys. All you need to bring are your beach towels and sunscreen!<br><br>Conveniently located within walking distance to Inlet beach, Shoppes at Inlet and 30Avenue. Short drive to Rosemary, Seaside, Alys Beache and The Hub. 25 Minutes from Northwest Florida Beach International Airport (ECP), 1 hour from Destin-Fort Walton Beach Airport (VPS) and 1 hour 45 minutes from Pensacola International Airport (PNS).<br><br>We look forward to sharing our home for your next beach vacation!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Coastal Chic Inlet Beach House minutes from the beach and 30A"
        }
      ],
